{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49494","headline":"木兰花 三 · 顾敻","name":"木兰花 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月皎露华窗影细，风送菊香黏绣袂。\n博山炉冷水沈微，惆怅金闺终日闭。\n嬾展罗衾垂玉筯，羞对菱花篸宝髻。\n良宵好事枉教休，无计那他狂耍壻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}